B.acY=new A.d2("Match Scores & Outcomes:","Numeric game scores, match timestamps, and verified final outcome records used to update skill ratings and settle prizes.",B.y,null)
B.acV=new A.d2("Financial & Transactional Records:","Ledger entries (deposits, entry fee locks, prize payouts, referral commissions, withdrawals), currency amounts, and payment transaction identifiers provided by our licensed payment processors. Full payment card numbers and CVV codes are transmitted directly to PCI-DSS Level 1 compliant processors and are never received or stored on Playverzus.xyz servers.",B.y,null)
