B.ad6=new A.d2("Betting, Lotteries and Gaming Act (Cap 131, BCLB):","Cap 131 regulates uncertain-outcome betting and games of chance. Direct peer-to-peer skill esports contests without house odds\u2014where participant stakes fund fixed-fee prize pools\u2014alongside risk-free Demo PTS mode are structured under the pure-skill exemption rationale.",B.cD,null)
B.ad5=new A.d2("Kenya Data Protection Act (2019):","Enforces our Zero Video Storage commitment: only official match scores and outcome records are retained.",B.cD,null)
B.acX=new A.d2("Consumer Protection Act (2012):","Automated verification, transparent upfront gateway fee disclosures, and formal 15-minute Human-in-the-Loop dispute resolution satisfy fairness standards.",B.cD,null)
