B.afb=new A.dS("Under common-law and statutory jurisprudence, gambling requires three concurrent elements: Prize, Consideration, and Chance. Playverzus.xyz operates strictly on contests governed by the Predominance Test, where outcomes depend predominantly upon player physical dexterity, tactical decision-making, reflex accuracy, map knowledge, and execution:",null)
B.ad0=new A.d2("Predominance Test Compliance:","Over standard match durations, RNG elements in eligible titles must never outweigh participant skill. Winners are determined by verified highest score, lowest completion time, or official round victory.",B.t,null)
B.acS=new A.d2("Zero Gambling or House Bank:","Games of chance (roulette, slots, dice, bingo, card lotteries) and house-banked odds are strictly banned. Playverzus does not act as a bookmaker or compete against players; prize pools are funded solely by participant stakes subject to disclosed fixed tier facilitation fees.",B.t,null)
